      "id": "start",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "If A and B together do 1/12 of a job each day, and B alone does 1/20, then A is not mysterious.\n\nA's rate = team rate − B's rate.\n\nWe are going to use subtraction to reveal hidden workers.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_1": {
      "id": "teach_1",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "A+B finish in 12 days; B alone finishes in 18.\n\nTeam rate = 1/12.\nB rate = 1/18.\nA rate = 1/12 − 1/18 = 1/36.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "teach_1_step"
        }
      ]
    },
    "teach_1_step": {
      "id": "teach_1_step",
      "type": "CONTENT",
      "content": {
        "text": "The solo time is the reciprocal of the hidden rate, so A takes 36 days.",
        "avatarPersona": "TUTOR"
      },
      "transitions": [
        {
          "targetNodeId": "q_1"
        }
      ]
    },
